When class spells were released in '''Alpha 3.0''', this card costed 4G to deal 6 DMG randomly split among all enemy monsters. '''Alpha 3.2''' increased the cost to 6G, and '''Beta 2.6''' brought it down to 5G.

'''Beta 3.1''' nerfed the effect to deal 5 DMG instead of 6. '''Beta 4.5''' followed that by increasing the cost back to 6G, but '''Beta 14.0''' brought it back down to 5G.

